# The Mac App Store provisioning profile. Tied to the signing team and
# regenerated from the developer portal, so it is a credential rather than
# source — build/entitlements.mas.plist references it by path.
build/embedded.provisionprofile
# The App Store screenshot editor (Next.js) and its exported PNGs. Scaffolded
# by the app-store-screenshots skill; not part of the Electron app's build.
app-store-screenshots/
# The Remotion project for the Product Hunt launch video. Scaffolded by
# `npx create-video`; marketing material, not part of the Electron app's build.
remotion/
